00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:14.500
So we have you today to talk
about the latest Kubernetes

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.210
version, Kubernetes 1.6.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:20.710
I was going to say 1.8 because
that is Go, but no, it's 1.6.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.630
And also we'll
talk at some point

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:27.850
the fact that Kubernetes
just migrated to Go 1.8.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.320
